      "summaries": {
        "en": "Agent Framework is a Microsoft-developed toolkit for creating and managing AI agents and multi-agent systems, addressing the complexity of coordinating multiple AI components in real-world applications. Its technical strength lies in providing a unified orchestration layer that seamlessly integrates Python and .NET agents, enabling developers to design sophisticated workflows where specialized agents collaborate on complex tasks. You can use it to build applications like customer service bots with specialized sub-agents for different query types, or research assistants where separate agents handle literature review, data analysis, and report generation in coordinated sequences.",
        "zh": "微软推出的开源Agent Framework旨在简化AI智能体及多智能体工作流的构建与部署，通过统一编排层无缝集成Python和.NET编写的智能体，帮助开发者设计复杂协作流程。该框架能协调多个专业化智能体协同完成任务，适用于多步骤应用场景，如客户服务系统（处理查询、解答、情感分析）或研究助手（文献检索、数据分析、报告生成），实现端到端自动化。",
        "es": "Agent Framework is a Microsoft-developed toolkit for creating and managing AI agents and multi-agent systems, addressing the complexity of coordinating multiple AI components in real-world applications. Its technical strength lies in providing a unified orchestration layer that seamlessly integrates Python and .NET agents, enabling developers to design sophisticated workflows where specialized agents collaborate on complex tasks. You can use it to build applications like customer service bots with specialized sub-agents for different query types, or research assistants where separate agents handle literature review, data analysis, and report generation in coordinated sequences.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "agent-framework stands out for agent-framework, agentic-ai, and agents in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Agent Framework is a Microsoft-developed toolkit for creating and managing AI agents and multi-agent systems, addressing the complexity of coordinating multiple AI components in real-world applications. Its technical strength lies in providing a unified orchestration layer that seamlessly integrates Python and .NET agents, enabling developers to design sophisticated workflows where specialized agents collaborate on complex tasks. You can use it to build applications like customer service bots with specialized sub-agents for different query types, or research assistants where separate agents handle literature review, data analysis, and report generation in coordinated sequences.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/microsoft/agent-framework for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
