      "summaries": {
        "en": "BGE-Reranker-Base is a cross-lingual reranking model that improves search and retrieval accuracy by reordering candidate documents based on query relevance. It builds on XLM-RoBERTa and is trained with contrastive learning to better distinguish subtle semantic differences between texts. You can integrate it into existing retrieval pipelines via Hugging Face Transformers or sentence-transformers to boost performance in multilingual QA, document search, or recommendation systems.",
        "zh": "BGE-Reranker-Base 是一个跨语言重排序模型，用于提升搜索和检索系统的准确性，通过对候选文档按查询相关性重新排序来优化结果。它基于 XLM-RoBERTa 架构，采用对比学习训练，能有效捕捉文本间的细微语义差异。开发者可通过 Hugging Face Transformers 或 sentence-transformers 库轻松集成到现有流程中，适用于多语言问答、文档检索或推荐系统等场景，以增强语义匹配效果。",
        "es": "BGE-Reranker-Base is a cross-lingual reranking model that improves search and retrieval accuracy by reordering candidate documents based on query relevance. It builds on XLM-RoBERTa and is trained with contrastive learning to better distinguish subtle semantic differences between texts. You can integrate it into existing retrieval pipelines via Hugging Face Transformers or sentence-transformers to boost performance in multilingual QA, document search, or recommendation systems.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "bge-reranker-base stands out for sentence-transformers, pytorch, and onnx in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "BGE-Reranker-Base is a cross-lingual reranking model that improves search and retrieval accuracy by reordering candidate documents based on query relevance. It builds on XLM-RoBERTa and is trained with contrastive learning to better distinguish subtle semantic differences between texts. You can integrate it into existing retrieval pipelines via Hugging Face Transformers or sentence-transformers to boost performance in multilingual QA, document search, or recommendation systems.",
          "how": "Review https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-reranker-base for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
